      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Dragon Mart 2, inaugurated in 2016, added 175,000 m² and 4,500 parking spaces, shifting the complex toward a traditional mall layout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        16,
        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
