      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Situated south of Al Awir Road (E 44) and east of Sheikh Mohammad Bin Zayed Road (E 311) in Dubai International City, it sits north of the China Cluster.",
